WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:21.936
Cool! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.937 --> 00:00:25.697
I'm a land hermit crab.

3
00:00:25.698 --> 00:00:30.219
Crabs are crustaceans.

4
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:32.924
Where do you live?

5
00:00:32.925 --> 00:00:38.255
Land hermit crabs live in tropical areas.

6
00:00:38.256 --> 00:00:42.505
We like sandy beaches.

7
00:00:42.506 --> 00:00:45.563
What do you eat?

8
00:00:45.564 --> 00:00:50.991
Land hermit crabs eat almost anything.

9
00:00:50.992 --> 00:00:56.374
We like leaves, wood, and grass.

10
00:00:56.375 --> 00:01:03.753
I like your claws!

11
00:01:03.754 --> 00:01:09.226
I grab food with my small claw.

12
00:01:09.227 --> 00:01:15.423
I can climb with my big claw.

13
00:01:15.424 --> 00:01:22.223
Why do you have that shell?

14
00:01:22.224 --> 00:01:26.812
A part of our body is soft.

15
00:01:26.813 --> 00:01:34.065
The shell protects that part.

16
00:01:34.066 --> 00:01:37.774
Where do you get your shells?

17
00:01:37.775 --> 00:01:42.550
We find our shells on the beach.

18
00:01:42.551 --> 00:01:47.059
Land hermit crabs grow a lot.

19
00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:52.785
So sometimes we need to find bigger shells!

20
00:01:52.786 --> 00:01:56.342
Do you live alone?

21
00:01:56.343 --> 00:02:00.329
Land hermit crabs live in groups.

22
00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:05.155
We help each other find food and shells.

23
00:02:05.156 --> 00:02:15.585
Shells are hard to find.

24
00:02:15.586 --> 00:02:19.787
I see a bigger shell now!

25
00:02:19.788 --> 00:02:24.593
Good-bye!

26
00:02:24.594 --> 00:02:31.954
Good-bye, Land Hermit Crab!
